          "claim_id": "cc107-nfp-029",
          "claim_text": "Sectors: Rate-sensitive shares could benefit from falling yields while cyclical businesses suffer if the report signals weaker demand. Conversely, stronger hiring could help growth-sensitive businesses despite higher financing costs. Watch which channel dominates.",
