        },
        {
          "claim_id": "cc107-nfp-030",
          "claim_text": "The strong branch gains credibility if payrolls and unemployment reinforce each other and rates and the dollar follow the firmer-policy interpretation. The weak branch needs employment weakness and a softer expected policy path. A reversal after revisions or wages are examined would challenge either reading; disagreement across markets would weaken a simple headline explanation.",
